-- src:1771 | section 14(2) of that Act against the employer — the
-- src:1772 | employer bears the burden of proving the allegation that
-- src:1773 | the employee was dismissed with just cause or excuse;
-- src:1775 | (b) where an employee is dismissed with notice by an
